The rating platform in benchmark/rating/ adapts design and code from two internal NSDA Corp
applications, nsdalab_ocr_labelling_app and nsdalab_regdoc-requirements_labelling_app
(multi-user annotation with provenance, content-hashed configurations, the coverage sampler,
the export API with HTTP Basic auth, the CLI, the web shell, stylesheet and layout script).
NSDA Corp, through its owner and founder Goran Calic, released this material for use in this
repository under the MIT License on 2026-10-22. No NSDA Corp data, documents or
regulatory-domain code are included.

We thank the NSDA lab team who designed and built the original applications.
